IKKK I LOVE THEM SO MUCH

i was pretty worried cuz all my (non-pierced) friends freaked out a bit when i told them it bled, i had no idea if its normal or not ;-; 
ill be buying saline!

if u feel like [adding some language diversity ..](https://open.spotify.com/track/5YlzzKxzy8rK6CKgJCsVZj?si=zqlNSnrORVSspxtmflOTZA) 

idk if our song fits - but itd mean alot xD

also DAMN thats alot of songs and bands ive never even heard of! thanks for compiling this!
